<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="split">

      <!-- Left Content -->
      <div class="rv">

        <p class="plate">Who we are</p>

        <h2 class="h2 mt-s">
          A group built around one question: what does industrial growth actually need?
        </h2>

        <p class="body-copy mt-m">
          Honeytreat Global Services Limited (HGSL) operates across equipment leasing,
          real estate development, compressed natural gas (CNG), mining, and software
          development. Rather than functioning as independent businesses, these
          divisions work together to solve the practical challenges that drive
          industrial growth—from access to heavy equipment and energy infrastructure
          to digital transformation and operational efficiency.
        </p>

        <p class="body-copy">
          This integrated structure gives us a unique advantage. The software we
          build is tested within our own operations before reaching clients. The
          equipment we lease is maintained using standards developed through years
          of field experience. Our property, mining and energy divisions work
          together to deliver sustainable, scalable solutions that create lasting
          value for businesses across Nigeria and Africa.
        </p>

        <p class="body-copy">
          Headquartered in Lagos, Honeytreat Global Services Limited continues to
          invest in innovation, strategic partnerships and technology, positioning
          itself as one of Africa's emerging industrial solutions companies.
        </p>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Image -->
